OpenMM
======

`OpenMM <https://openmm.org>`_ is a molecular-dynamics toolkit with a Python
API, used widely for biomolecular simulation with classical force fields such
as Amber. `OpenMM-ML <https://github.com/openmm/openmm-ml>`_ connects that
API to machine-learning potentials. A metatomic model is registered with
it at runtime and then used for the ligand in a mixed ML/MM system.

- examples/openmm-metatomic/benzene-lysozyme
